     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-TERMINATION-DATE-0415             PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-BIRTH-DATE-0415                   PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-FIRST-NAME-0415               PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-LAST-NAME-0415                PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-STREET-0415                   PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-CITY-0415                     PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-STATE-0415                    PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-ZIP-FIRST-FIVE-0415           PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-ZIP-LAST-FOUR-0415            PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-EMP-PHONE-0415                    PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-STATUS-0415                       PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-SS-NUMBER-0415                    PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-DEPT-ID-0410                      PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPLOYEE-OFFICE-CODE-0450                  PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPOSITION-FINISH-DATE-0420                PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPOSITION-SALARY-GRADE-0420               PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPOSITION-SALARY-AMOUNT-0420              PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPOSITION-BONUS-PERCENT-0420              PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPOSITION-COMMISSION-PERCENT-0420         PIC S9(4) COMP.
     01 NI-EMPOSITION-OVERTIME-RATE-0420              PIC S9(4) COMP.
